<title>UK: BGB Finance sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</title>
<headline>BGB Finance sets 1.0 bln Czech crown one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE (IRELAND) PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN GROUP</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    06.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.85    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    100	 SPREAD	=</p>
